"><span begin="00:33.190" end="00:33.820">Honestly</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.820" end="00:35.740"><span begin="00:33.820" end="00:34.030">'Cuz </span><span begin="00:34.030" end="00:34.810">creativity </span><span begin="00:34.810" end="00:35.020">could </span><span begin="00:35.020" end="00:35.320">never </span><span begin="00:35.320" end="00:35.740">bloom</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.740" end="00:36.520"><span begin="00:35.740" end="00:35.860">In </span><span begin="00:35.860" end="00:36.130">my </span><span begin="00:36.130" end="00:36.520">room</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.520" end="00:38.440"><span begin="00:36.520" end="00:36.700">I'd </span><span begin="00:36.700" end="00:36.940">throw </span><span begin="00:36.940" end="00:37.090">it </span><span begin="00:37.090" end="00:37.300">all </span><span begin="00:37.300" end="00:37.540">away </span><span begin="00:37.540" end="00:37.900">before </span><span begin="00:37.900" end="00:37.990">I </span><span begin="00:37.990" end="00:38.440">lie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.470" end="00:40.360"><span begin="00:38.470" end="00:38.710">So </span><span begin="00:38.710" end="00:38.860">don't </span><span begin="00:38.860" end="00:39.190">call </span><span begin="00:39.190" end="00:39.370">me </span><span begin="00:39.370" end="00:39.580">with </span><span begin="00:39.580" end="00:39.640">a </span><span begin="00:39.640" end="00:40.360">compromise</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.360" end="00:41.290"><span begin="00:40.360" end="00:40.600">Hang </span><span begin="00:40.600" end="00:40.690">up </span><span begin="00:40.690" end="00:40.780">the </span><span begin="00:40.780" end="00:41.290">phone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.290" end="00:43.600"><span begin="00:41.290" end="00:41.380">I've </span><span begin="00:41.380" end="00:41.620">got </span><span begin="00:41.620" end="00:41.680">a </span><span begin="00:41.680" end="00:42.280">backbone </span><s