</span><span begin="01:20.800" end="01:20.950">and </span><span begin="01:20.950" end="01:24.130">try</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.310" end="01:25.600"><span begin="01:24.310" end="01:24.640">Go </span><span begin="01:24.640" end="01:25.210">ahead </span><span begin="01:25.210" end="01:25.330">and </span><span begin="01:25.330" end="01:25.600">try</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.600" end="01:26.170"><span begin="01:25.600" end="01:25.790">You </span><span begin="01:25.790" end="01:25.980">don't </span><span begin="01:25.980" end="01:26.170">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.200" end="01:28.030"><span begin="01:26.200" end="01:26.500">You </span><span begin="01:26.500" end="01:26.740">think </span><span begin="01:26.740" end="01:26.830">you </span><span begin="01:26.830" end="01:27.100">know </span><span begin="01:27.100" end="01:27.370">me </span><span begin="01:27.370" end="01:27.580">like </span><span begin="01:27.580" end="01:28.030">yourself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.030" end="01:28.840"><span begin="01:28.030" end="01:28.270">But </span><span begin="01:28.270" end="01:28.330">I </span><span begin="01:28.330" end="01:28.840">fear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.990" end="01:31.240"><span begin="01:28.990" end="01:29.260">That </span><span begin="01:29.260" end="01:29.440">you're </span><span begin="01:29.440" end="01:29.650">only </span><span begin="01:29.650" end="01:30.040">telling </span><span begin="01:30.040" end="01:30.310">me </span><span begin="01:30.310" end="01:30.580">what </span><span begin="01:30.580" end="01:30.670">I </span><span begin="01:30.670" end="01:31.000">wanna </span><span begin="01:31.000" end="01:31.240">hear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.240" end="01:32.410"><span begin="01:31.240" end="01:31.360">But </span><span begin="01:31.360" end="01:31.480">do </span><span begin="01:31.480" end="01:31.660">you </span><span begin="01:31.660" end="01:31.930">give </span><span begi